    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n112522" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φυκτός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ή</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>, older and poet. form of <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φευκτός,</span>
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>to be shunned</i> or
				<i>escaped, avoidable,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὐκέτι φυκτὰ πέλωνται</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					16.128
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				8.299
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				14.489
			</span></i>.</div>
